      "message": "drivers/virtio-snd: bounded output-only PCM_INFO codec (#85)\n\nIntegrate the isolated no_std output codec and its bounded negative tests. No device I/O, capture, DMA authority, production audio or H03 acceptance is claimed.\n\nValidation on PR head 72f6668d313ab39a25f952abd6456d5e5e8db95e against main ca45a7d: all 13 GitHub Actions checks succeeded, including host-quality and qemu-smoke; no unresolved review threads. CodeRabbit check was skipped and is not counted as review approval. Source reviewed independently; rubric remains 34/100."
